 Note: To avoid confusion with existing SCPs, any SCPs unique to the Sxlaris universe have an &quot;x&quot; designation in their name (i.e SCP-x173 instead of SCP-173).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["HellStorm Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459840/8f98bd07affa319b91a22680526b2eb2c6f454d0/header.jpg?t=1757188981","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All elements of the SCP Foundation, and The Backrooms are licensed under CC BY-SA 3.0. Unless otherwise stated, all Sxlaris characters fall under this same license. However, the titles \"Sxlaris\", \"Kult Rising\", and \"Sxlar Wasteland\" are licensed trademarks of Sxlar Wasteland and must not be reused or redistributed without express permission. In the same way, the actual code of this game is NOT licensed under CC BY-SA and remains the copyright and trademark of HellStorm Software and Sxlar Wasteland.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3459840/843004/56e9d8509ffa0507a6900dc698e15d693ba4486b/1750853145/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743522448","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3459840/843004/56e9d8509ffa0507a6900dc698e15d693ba4486b/1750853145/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743522448","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3459840/843004/56e9d8509ffa0507a6900dc698e15d693ba4486b/1750853145/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743522448","id":257109050,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109050/movie480.mp4?t=1743522448","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109050/movie_max.mp4?t=1743522448"},"name":"Alpha 0.1.6.22 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item